{"5032550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ebru Artist Simulator", "steam_appid": 5032550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ebru Artist Simulator</strong> is a physics-based paper marbling game where you paint on water, manage your own workshop, and turn every creation into a masterpiece worth selling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/f4f114157d19db1a78d7c76b3e520673.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1400 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the timeless art of <strong>Ebru</strong>, also known as <strong>paper marbling</strong>. Paint on the surface of water using a realistic <strong>physics-based simulation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/fc7b36eaa53f365e8dd0b7a108891cac.poster.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/fc7b36eaa53f365e8dd0b7a108891cac.webm?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/fc7b36eaa53f365e8dd0b7a108891cac.mp4?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/ef4b62ef0adfad73edbf53c9607052e5.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1400 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft</strong> and customize traditional Ebru tools, such as <strong>“biz”</strong> and <strong>rakes</strong>. Create <strong>new tools</strong> from your imagination and experiment with <strong>new marbling techniques</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/771d6bba03f58d41e61551d64f32f52e.poster.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/771d6bba03f58d41e61551d64f32f52e.webm?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/771d6bba03f58d41e61551d64f32f52e.mp4?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/5134a2fb697ca412484d57c719aa54d3.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1400 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your <strong>customers</strong>' ideas to life. <strong>Complete orders</strong>, impress your clients, and <strong>build</strong> <strong>your</strong> <strong>reputation</strong> with every successful <strong>artwork</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/7d6439259bc0cad3d1e196ec12a2503d.poster.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/7d6439259bc0cad3d1e196ec12a2503d.webm?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/7d6439259bc0cad3d1e196ec12a2503d.mp4?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/2e5df81a4306df16682627d9a7d3f4e9.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1400 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a humble studio into the <strong>workshop of your dreams</strong>. <strong>Expand</strong> your space, <strong>decorate</strong> it with new <strong>furniture</strong>, <strong>paint</strong> the walls, and create an inspiring environment that reflects your <strong>artistic style</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/f7550952374cd9ab7c539f6fd17a3f19.poster.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/f7550952374cd9ab7c539f6fd17a3f19.webm?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/f7550952374cd9ab7c539f6fd17a3f19.mp4?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/ce7d9047c6b7e8b33f2476f41f75fd3e.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1400 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show the world your finest creations by <strong>hosting </strong>your own<strong> exhibitions</strong>. Display your favorite <strong>paintings</strong> on the <strong>gallery</strong> walls, welcome <strong>visitors</strong>, <strong>negotiate</strong> with potential buyers, and <strong>sell</strong> your artwork to grow your <strong>reputation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/f74a43c292c94f5886f71cdd77dfbd32.poster.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/f74a43c292c94f5886f71cdd77dfbd32.webm?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/f74a43c292c94f5886f71cdd77dfbd32.mp4?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ebru Artist Simulator</strong> is a physics-based paper marbling game where you paint on water, manage your own workshop, and turn every creation into a masterpiece worth selling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/f4f114157d19db1a78d7c76b3e520673.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1400 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the timeless art of <strong>Ebru</strong>, also known as <strong>paper marbling</strong>. Paint on the surface of water using a realistic <strong>physics-based simulation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/fc7b36eaa53f365e8dd0b7a108891cac.poster.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/fc7b36eaa53f365e8dd0b7a108891cac.webm?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/fc7b36eaa53f365e8dd0b7a108891cac.mp4?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/ef4b62ef0adfad73edbf53c9607052e5.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1400 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft</strong> and customize traditional Ebru tools, such as <strong>“biz”</strong> and <strong>rakes</strong>. Create <strong>new tools</strong> from your imagination and experiment with <strong>new marbling techniques</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/771d6bba03f58d41e61551d64f32f52e.poster.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/771d6bba03f58d41e61551d64f32f52e.webm?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/771d6bba03f58d41e61551d64f32f52e.mp4?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/5134a2fb697ca412484d57c719aa54d3.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1400 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your <strong>customers</strong>' ideas to life. <strong>Complete orders</strong>, impress your clients, and <strong>build</strong> <strong>your</strong> <strong>reputation</strong> with every successful <strong>artwork</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/7d6439259bc0cad3d1e196ec12a2503d.poster.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/7d6439259bc0cad3d1e196ec12a2503d.webm?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/7d6439259bc0cad3d1e196ec12a2503d.mp4?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/2e5df81a4306df16682627d9a7d3f4e9.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1400 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a humble studio into the <strong>workshop of your dreams</strong>. <strong>Expand</strong> your space, <strong>decorate</strong> it with new <strong>furniture</strong>, <strong>paint</strong> the walls, and create an inspiring environment that reflects your <strong>artistic style</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/f7550952374cd9ab7c539f6fd17a3f19.poster.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/f7550952374cd9ab7c539f6fd17a3f19.webm?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/f7550952374cd9ab7c539f6fd17a3f19.mp4?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/ce7d9047c6b7e8b33f2476f41f75fd3e.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1400 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show the world your finest creations by <strong>hosting </strong>your own<strong> exhibitions</strong>. Display your favorite <strong>paintings</strong> on the <strong>gallery</strong> walls, welcome <strong>visitors</strong>, <strong>negotiate</strong> with potential buyers, and <strong>sell</strong> your artwork to grow your <strong>reputation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/f74a43c292c94f5886f71cdd77dfbd32.poster.avif?t=1788358906\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/f74a43c292c94f5886f71cdd77dfbd32.webm?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/extras/f74a43c292c94f5886f71cdd77dfbd32.mp4?t=1788358906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Ebru Artist Simulator is an artist sim game with physics-based painting and workshop management. Paint vibrant artworks with realistic fluid simulation. Craft your tools, sell and showcase your paintings, upgrade your workshop, attract new customers, and rise from beginner to a master Ebru artist.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/20211034cb7f6e8734cd93c07e6b72336a3a5935/header.jpg?t=1788358906", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/179c9db6a495b1c56add70cba477a8f69ae038f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788358906", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5032550/179c9db6a495b1c56add70cba477a8f69ae038f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788358906", "website": "https://www.stillwatergamestudio.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><